# The varnamelen ignore list is a YAML flow sequence with comments grouping the
# names into three annotated categories -- which is how anyone adding a
# one-letter name knows where to put it. Prettier explodes a flow sequence to
# one entry per line, and the grouping stops meaning anything.
.golangci.yml

# Local scratch written by the code-* skills. Prettier reads this repo's
# .gitignore but not the global core.excludesfile, and `.issues` is ignored
# through the latter -- so git hides it and prettier would not. Without this
# line the gate fails on files the repository does not carry.
.issues/
